          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='24500' id='11' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='50000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Key finding</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> A 30% share-price decline combined with a 50% increase in equity volatility reduced risk-neutral distance to default from 5.93 to 3.49. Model-implied default probability rose to approximately 0.0243%.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='24500' id='12' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='74500'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Method and assumptions</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> Retrospective analysis using the 30 March 2026 closing price and 31 March 2026 reported borrowings. Borrowings are simplified into one payment due in one year; leases are excluded. The risk-free rate is an illustrative 6%. Probabilities are risk-neutral model estimates, not actual default forecasts.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
